  "description": "Sealed, independent evaluation benchmark for Step 4 candidate generation, semantic attribution, and non-finding rejection. Contains 60 completely new cases NOT derived from the 22 forensic audit facts: 30 positive archaeological findings and 30 hard negative non-findings (including adversarial negatives: page citations inside excavation sentences, author-date citations in artifact discussions, contour intervals in methods paragraphs, plate/figure indices adjacent to dimensions, and footnote numbers fused to measurements).",
